---
// REFRAME — homepage-only full-width dark statement band, added 2026-09-03 per the homepage
// composition rebuild (docs/05-DECISIONS-LOG.md, "Homepage section count reopened," 2026-09-03).
// This is the "Type B" full-width background / contained content section the design system
// calls for between lighter photographic movements — a genuine composition change (dark field,
// centered statement), not a navy rectangle wrapped around the same layout.
//
// Copy is new to this pass but follows the same discipline as every other homepage module: one
// short statement plus one supporting sentence, no restored essay. It restates the site's
// existing positioning (condition-first assessment, written scope) rather than introducing a new
// claim — nothing here is a fact not already stated in WhatWeHandle or OperatingEvidence.
---

<section class="reframe" aria-labelledby="reframe-title">
  <div class="reframe__inner">
    <p class="reframe__eyebrow">How we think about a property</p>
    <h2 id="reframe-title" class="ac-type-h2-home-feature">
      The condition decides the work. Not the other way around.
    </h2>
    <p class="reframe__lede">
      Two properties that look similar from the street can need completely different plans.
      Aseptaclean looks at what is actually there before anything is scheduled, priced, or
      promised.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reframe {
    background: var(--ac-color-navy-950);
    padding-block: clamp(80px, 8vw, 116px);
  }

  .reframe__inner {
    width: min(100% - 64px, 900px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .reframe__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--ac-color-blue-on-navy);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .reframe__inner {
    --ac-text-h2-home-feature: 2.75rem;
  }

  .reframe__inner h2 {
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: 18ch;
    color: var(--ac-color-paper);
  }

  .reframe__lede {
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
    color: #ccd9e8;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .reframe__inner {
      --ac-text-h2-home-feature: 2.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .reframe {
      padding-block: 64px;
    }

    .reframe__inner {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .reframe__inner {
      --ac-text-h2-home-feature: 2rem;
    }

    .reframe__lede {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
    }
  }
</style>
